{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7f66a2b004fe46fc3978c686fde0e544f3a3c493a86ded71c647c21008ef04f8", "ja": "（今日は怪盗vs警察を描くドラマの撮影だ！\n出演するジュリアの役柄は……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄一部描写怪盗与警察对决的电视剧！出演的茱莉亚所饰演的角色是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "a94f190e016c4f80cdb6fa404d02d3eace290d0ae2467325c85329eae9f0ad26", "ja": "まさか、あたしが警察側を演じるなんてな……。\nこういうのも、ヤキが回ったっていうのか？", "zh": "没想到我居然要演警察这一方啊……\n这就叫……脑子转不过弯了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ad1ab351a8110f9abbadbed3c0317508124713830a0054a4a5846a4a79c64b7c", "ja": "はは……ジュリア、この役は不満か？", "zh": "哈哈……茱莉亚，你对这个角色不满意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "e77c278e2be3fd22b0a84a3820839c41d218fc9211800ec51b7c95eae577ec16", "ja": "まさか！　役をもらえるのはありがたいし、\nやるならもちろん全力だ。それは当然だろ？", "zh": "怎么会！能拿到这个角色我很感激，\n既然要演，当然会全力以赴。这不是理所当然的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "5f6b16d89581ed4ec871e8095f76e84815a8bac5a567eea60725b4ad544df681", "ja": "ただ、刑事役をやることに\nちょっと戸惑ってるのは確かだよ。", "zh": "不过，要出演刑警这个角色，我确实还是有点不知所措。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "8b2cc1c3e72c90087f4ec360380ace4565a12aa6094ae483d129819802ad4a13", "ja": "なんといっても、あたしは\nロックなアイドル、ってやつだからな。", "zh": "不管怎么说，我可是摇滚偶像啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1006_p", "source_sha256": "18efdcdb8d50998f0a6a0e5e86b5958d36c1ed6f2744b8042e0255fcb38c52cc", "ja": "そうか……ロックが信条のジュリアとしては、\n抵抗があるっていう感じなのか？", "zh": "这样啊……作为以摇滚为信条的茱莉亚，会觉得有些抵触吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "9208a5e9a35461d83f95de30e0cab4a91b38d86b04b5c7537fc0e205623a00a5", "ja": "そりゃ、反骨こそがロックの魂だしな。\nそれなのに、演技とはいえ刑事役……難しいよ。", "zh": "那当然，反抗精神才是摇滚的灵魂嘛。\n可即便只是演戏，要演刑警……也太难了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1008_p", "source_sha256": "04f2376623aaa7c4e3a73c19e00dccd302eff67f6dd1292a155ea783fc37ed0e", "ja": "おいおい、しっかりしてくれよ。\n今から役を変わるなんて事は、さすがに……。", "zh": "喂喂，振作点啊。\n事到如今再换角色什么的，也未免……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "8969dde50c03ccb5855de861d81ca789536daeaaff2135642da8cded4567edab", "ja": "心配するなよ、{$P$}！\nセリフもちゃんと覚えたし、しっかりやるって。", "zh": "别担心啦，{$P$}！\n台词我都好好记住了，肯定会好好演的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "3080825b3e1faf9136a563b33fdd50673e137e69b63d30d3bcf4bb391736cdfd", "ja": "そういえば……あたしがやるこの刑事は、\n誰にも弱みを見せないって役だったっけ……。", "zh": "说起来……我演的这个刑警，设定是绝不向任何人示弱来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1011_p", "source_sha256": "68546cdcf42614b2ce1203f9eddfe8b976e6dce04a93f5cf363c48b5914611d9", "ja": "ああ。もしかしたらだけど……この刑事は、\n弱い自分を内に秘めてるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "啊。虽然只是我的猜测……这位刑警，或许把脆弱的自己藏在了内心深处。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "b220a9ec14494c788377b210eeda04421136eca75fc2d18887a5c319bc55e1de", "ja": "なるほど……。弱い自分を表に出さないために、\n硬派を演じてるってコトか。あり得るな。", "zh": "原来如此……。也就是说，为了不让软弱的自己暴露出来，才故意装出一副硬派的样子吗？确实有可能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "96b210d1243496a784fd78853196866db49bc9e2937e5c72af208b3d7a01db54", "ja": "本当に戦うべき相手は、自分の中にいる、って。\nそんな設定があるわけじゃないかもしれないけど。", "zh": "真正应该面对的对手，就在自己心中——我是这么想的。\n不过，也不一定真的有这样的设定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "b3e4b907bc0eaab2a38183defc395379baf19c15f2421dfe44f0f8159fff006c", "ja": "それなら、この刑事は十分にロックかもしれない。\nサンキュー、{$P$}！", "zh": "既然这样，这位刑警也足够摇滚了。\n谢啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4e923cdf33a975a44a9d5db4e2e0b0d0829f86e809572cc31a2e9571da02672b", "ja": "思いがけず、役への糸口が見つかったみたいだな……。\nそれじゃ、撮影頑張って来い！　期待してるぞ！", "zh": "没想到，似乎意外地找到了理解这个角色的线索……  \n那么，拍摄加油！我很期待哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "a0e92f7f3f972d993acbb1487bb18c5dcc957aa58ec978f4575f5b2f976623cc", "ja": "OK！　あ、けど{$P$}。\nあたしが役作りで悩んでたことは、その……。", "zh": "OK！啊，不过{$P$}。\n我为揣摩角色而烦恼的事，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6614b51b35c780b7d081e40709f4cd7448f626cca9372f97c5b225e3b5aa0dc3", "ja": "わかった。ジュリアがロックじゃない役を\n演じるのに悩んでたって事は、秘密にしておくよ。", "zh": "知道了。关于茱莉亚因为要饰演非摇滚角色而烦恼这件事，我会替你保密的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0174_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "de5e22fa6b0c8279606bf84c4c9dfff40479d06314ba0d89618f86cadf423c7b", "ja": "お、おい！　……ったく、\n改めて言わなくてもいいんだよ、バカP！", "zh": "喂、喂！……真是的，不用特地再说一遍啦，笨蛋制作人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
